# Scripts & pnpm

- Use **pnpm** exclusively. The repo pins it via `packageManager` in [`package.json`](mdc:package.json).
- Commands live in [`Taskfile.yml`](mdc:Taskfile.yml) — run `task --list` before adding a new one. Do not add a `scripts` block to `package.json`.
- Type-check with **tsgo** (`task typecheck`), not raw `tsc`. Scripts use `tsgo -p tsconfig.scripts.json`.
- Bundling: Vite owns the popup; [`scripts/build.ts`](mdc:scripts/build.ts) drives Rolldown for the background/content/inpage worlds. Mirror their logging/output conventions when adding a new build target.
- `console.*` is allowed in `scripts/**` (Biome override). It is NOT allowed in `src/**` outside the dedicated logging utilities (`src/background/log.ts`, `src/popup/toast.ts`).
